      "control_id": "CTL.CODEBUILD.PRIVILEGED.001",
      "control_name": "CodeBuild Projects Must Not Use Docker Privileged Mode",
      "control_description": "CodeBuild projects must not enable Docker privileged mode unless building Docker images is required. Privileged mode grants the build container full access to the host, enabling container escape. A compromised build with privileged mode gains the build role's permissions on the underlying host.\n",
